/E (We aim to deliver top-notch tools and entertainment to our customers who attend spectator events in arenas or stadiums. Our company has developed high-quality hardware, the Smart Ball, along with an intelligent portfolio solution app. This app validates players' and teams' skills through data streams from our Smart Ball, enabling fans to engage in sports trading using machine learning and artificial intelligence. Spectators can place bets based on verified game analytics from our Tech Ball game stats, utilizing real-time data predictions to potentially earn substantial profits with insights from teams and players. NIBLS leverages the collected stats through our exchange marketplace at live spectator events, employing sports trading strategies such as scalping, arbitrage, and hedging. Enhance your sports predictions with real-time biometrics. The Tech+Ball product can revolutionize club recruitment by utilizing web3 for players' career path training, offering users a learn-to-earn experience before transitioning to a professional club. Players and teams can enhance in-game decision-making during practices, tournaments, seasons, and playoffs, while also improving betting strategies and probabilities. The Tech+Ball sports challenge determines wins and losses based on data from seasons and playoffs. Furthermore, this innovation can assist American football, European Rugby, and European team and beach handball clubs in recruitment and training endeavors.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
